## Binary Distributions

Executables and libraries built from this repository statically link the Lean 4
runtime and standard library (Apache License 2.0,
https://github.com/leanprover/lean4), which contains mimalloc (MIT,
https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc), and libuv (MIT,
https://github.com/libuv/libuv).

- Distributed binaries (release CLI, C library bundle, Node.js addon) use the
  Lean runtime rebuilt without GMP (`scripts/build_runtime_nogmp.sh`,
  `ELK_NO_GMP=1`) and contain no LGPL-licensed code. The WebAssembly build
  never contains GMP.
- A plain `lake build` links the Lean toolchain's runtime, which statically
  includes GMP 6.3.0 (GNU LGPL v3, https://gmplib.org). Such builds are for
  local use; distributing them carries the LGPL v3 section 4 obligations
  described in `docs/gmp-licensing.md`.
